    "description": "Objective\n\nOne place to see Sign-Up volume across every status, filterable by Rep.\n\nImplementation Requirements\n\n* Reports covering each Sign-Up status\n\n* Dashboard assembling them with a Rep filter\n\nAcceptance Criteria\n\n* Dashboard shows all statuses and filters cleanly by Rep\n\nAdditional Notes\n\nSCOPE BOUNDARY: per the standing reporting rule, Salesforce does rollups and automation; the BI tool does the visual/analytical layer. Keep this dashboard OPERATIONAL (queue management) so it does not quietly grow into the analytics layer.\n\nStatus values must reflect the four-value model from BUILD-18.\n\nEstimate: S · \\~5h\n\nSource: Wagertech Additional User Stories, July 2026 — item 13.",
